# Review ownership. GitHub requests these reviewers automatically.
#
# Later lines win, so the specific rules at the bottom override the catch-all.
#
# Individual handles for now. Swap in org teams (engineering, product) once they
# exist; a team that does not exist silently matches nobody, which is worse than no
# CODEOWNERS at all.
#
# Note: `require_code_owner_reviews` is currently OFF in branch protection, because a
# solo maintainer cannot approve their own pull request and main would deadlock. Turn
# it on when a second reviewer joins.

